[h1]My "Quoted" Mod[/h1]
[url=https://example.com]Logo[/url] [url=https://github.com/owner/repo/blob/main/test/README.md][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/owner/repo/main/test/fixtures/img/shot.png[/img][/url]

A paragraph with [b]bold[/b], [b]bold too[/b], [i]italic[/i], [i]italic too[/i], [strike]struck[/strike] and [noparse]inline [b]code[/b][/noparse]. It continues on a second line, and has a hard break at the end
and a [url=https://github.com/owner/repo/blob/main/test/docs/guide.md#install]relative link[/url], an anchor and https://example.org. Escaped *stars*, a back\slash, a C:\path\to\file and & entities <3.

Only on the [url=https://steamcommunity.com/]Workshop[/url]

